<title>USA: Washington Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Washington Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $5.995 million of Washington Township, N.J., general obligation general bonds of 1996, with the lowest rate of 5.20, high est price of 100.084.</p>
</text>
